## Things never do in this project

- Never build features outside the scope without asking
- Never invent endpoints not in the API contract
- Never add fields to the data model without updating PROJECT.md
- Never introduce a new library without justifying it
- Never skip the audit log on a state change
- Never store PDFs in the database
- Never expose raw S3 URLs; always presigned
- Never start Phase 2 until Phase 1 is deployed and demoable
- Never build custom auth; use Clerk
